WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:01,220
Forget about the elevator

2
00:00:01,220 --> 00:00:03,420
What if you meet a crazy infected person inside?

3
00:00:03,420 --> 00:00:04,420
Didn't even get out of hiding

4
00:00:04,420 --> 00:00:20,150
More than a dozen project teams

5
00:00:20,150 --> 00:00:21,150
Stop when you say stop

6
00:00:21,150 --> 00:00:22,950
How do you say it's disbanded? It's disbanded.

7
00:00:22,950 --> 00:00:27,180
This is what you pay back

8
00:00:27,180 --> 00:00:34,840
What do you want to go back to?

9
00:00:34,840 --> 00:00:36,240
Everyone is safe

10
00:00:36,240 --> 00:00:37,740
No infection

11
00:00:37,740 --> 00:00:43,990
Okay, okay

12
00:00:43,990 --> 00:00:44,990
What's the fuss about?

13
00:00:44,990 --> 00:00:46,990
No one cares if you copy again

14
00:00:46,990 --> 00:00:47,990
Talk to your boss yourself

15
00:00:47,990 --> 00:00:50,310
I came here today to resign.

16
00:00:50,310 --> 00:00:51,510
Stop giving me poison

17
00:00:51,510 --> 00:00:55,450
Whatever you have to do, go ahead.

18
00:00:55,450 --> 00:00:57,250
Where can I go to get rescue in the future?

19
00:00:57,250 --> 00:00:58,450
Take my brother with you

20
00:00:59,850 --> 00:01:01,250
Want to know

21
00:01:01,250 --> 00:01:02,250
Turn back later

22
00:01:02,250 --> 00:01:03,250
Let's go out for a drink
